      "name": "Quiet refresh",
      "kind": "button",
      "description": "A visible utility label and SVG with no enclosing panel.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-af-refresh\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 7v5h-5M4 17v-5h5M5.4 7a7.5 7.5 0 0 1 12.3-2L20 8M4 16l2.3 3A7.5 7.5 0 0 0 18.6 17\"/></svg><span>Refresh</span></button>",
      "css": ".ds-af-refresh{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:10px 0 10px 10px;min-height:40px;border:0;border-radius:4px;background:none;color:var(--muted,#576172);font:13px 'DM Sans',sans-serif;cursor:pointer;transition:color 150ms ease}.ds-af-refresh svg{width:20px}.ds-af-refresh:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent,#b33326);outline-offset:3px;}.ds-af-refresh:disabled{opacity:.5;cursor:default}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:no-preference){@keyframes ds-af-refresh-turn{to{transform:rotate(360deg)}}.ds-af-refresh[aria-busy=\"true\"] svg{animation:ds-af-refresh-turn 1.2s linear infinite}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-af-refresh{transition:none}}",
      "refersTo": "button-quiet"
    },
    {
      "name": "Reviewer search",
      "kind": "input",
      "description": "Filters reviewer names while typing, without a redundant Search button. Enter opens a unique match.",
      "html": "<label class=\"ds-af-search\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m16 16 4 4M18 10.5a7.5 7.5 0 1 1-15 0 7.5 7.5 0 0 1 15 0\"/></svg><input type=\"search\" aria-label=\"Find a reviewer by name or account address\" placeholder=\"Find a reviewer\"/></label>",
      "css": ".ds-af-search{display:block;position:relative;max-width:600px}.ds-af-search svg{position:absolute;left:13px;top:15px;width:17px;color:var(--ink,#111b28);pointer-events:none}.ds-af-search input{width:100%;height:48px;padding:11px 12px 11px 40px;font:13px 'DM Sans',sans-serif;border:1px solid #a4acb4;border-radius:4px;background:transparent;color:var(--ink,#111b28);caret-color:var(--accent,#b33326)}.ds-af-search input::placeholder{color:var(--muted,#576172)}.ds-af-search input:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent,#b33326);outline-offset:3px;}",
      "refersTo": "input-search"
    },
    {
      "name": "Editorial navigation",
      "kind": "nav",
      "description": "Quiet sans-serif links leave the serif masthead in charge.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-af-nav\" aria-label=\"Main navigation\"><a href=\"https://portfolios.appcalipse.com\" aria-current=\"page\">Reviewers</a><a href=\"https://sidequest.appcalipse.com\">Explore games <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 17 17 7M7 7h10v10\"/></svg></a></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-af-nav{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:40px;font:14px 'DM Sans',sans-serif;color:var(--ink,#111b28)}.ds-af-nav a{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;color:inherit;text-decoration:none;transition:color 150ms ease}.ds-af-nav a[aria-current]{color:var(--accent,#b33326)}.ds-af-nav svg{width:16px}.ds-af-nav a:hover{text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:5px}.ds-af-nav a:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent,#b33326);outline-offset:3px;}@media(max-width:800px){.ds-af-nav{gap:20px;font-size:12px}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-af-nav a{transition:none}}"
    },
